---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const crumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: `${base}/` }, { label: 'Disclaimer' }];
---
<Base title="Disclaimer" description="Accuracy, advertising and affiliate disclosures for Global Sports Archive, and why nothing here should be relied on for betting or financial decisions." crumbs={crumbs}>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        We check every figure we publish and state on each archive how far its data has
        been verified. Even so, records are compiled by people and errors are possible.
        Nothing here should be treated as an official record; where a result matters,
        confirm it with the governing body. Tell us about any mistake and we will correct
        it and note the change on the page.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site carries advertising, which pays for the work. Advertisements are served
        by third parties, including Google, which may use cookies to select and measure
        the ads you see. What appears in an advertisement is not chosen or endorsed by us,
        and advertising never influences what we cover or how we cover it. See the
        <a href={`${base}/privacy/`}>privacy policy</a> and
        <a href={`${base}/cookies/`}>cookie policy</a> for the detail.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links may earn us a commission if you buy something after following them.
        Such links never cost you more, and they are never the reason a subject is
        covered. Where a page contains one, it is marked on that page.
      </p>
      <p class="note">
        ЗАМЕСТИТЕЛ — щом се включи конкретна партньорска програма (напр. Amazon Associates),
        тук влиза изискваното от нея изявление дословно. Всяка програма има свой текст.
      </p>

      <h2>No professional advice</h2>
      <p>
        The content here is published for reference and general interest. It is not
        advice, and nothing on this site should be relied on for betting, financial or
        any other decision.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        We link to other sites where they are useful. We do not control them and are not
        responsible for their content or their privacy practices.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
